    "created_at": "2016-07-19T19:01:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T19:01:14Z",
    "body": "So in this case per spec nothing should happen since 'nearest activatable element' finds the button element and then after click 'run post-click activation steps' is run on the button, and type=button's activation behavior is to do nothing.\n\nBut activation steps should run on the anchor element.\nFF, Chrome and Safari at least have this behavior.\n",
