    "created_at": "2024-01-02T15:09:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-02T15:09:56Z",
    "body": "The specification changed by now and this issue can be resolved.\r\n\r\nA [button](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-button-element) always has activation behavior. In above example during [dispatch](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch), it will become the activation target. Then the listeners are invoked and the button's type changes to submit. Afterwards the activation behavior of button is run, which now is to submit the form.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
