    "created_at": "2024-01-16T10:08:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-16T10:08:21Z",
    "body": "I couldn't find a test for `<a href>`. But while writing a test, I noticed I made a mistake, sorry.\r\n\r\nPer the spec, the form should be submitted, not the anchor activated. Which is still not the desired behavior described in this issue.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1567#issuecomment-1882843263 might fix this. If `<button type=button>`won't have activation behavior, the anchor becomes activation target.",
